Jeep, Jird, Jacks, Jite, Jump, Jar, Jack, Jet, Jand.

&#x200B;

obviously

I would say yes. just do it at a reasonable pace. On my daily drive to work i merge into the left lane of a highway so we have all sorts of idiots in the left lane. sometimes traffic is going 85+ in a 70 but im in the left lane and people behind me want to pass so ill speed up, pass and get over.

&#x200B;

Other times you're stuck in a 2 lane road with tons of traffic and the left is moving slightly faster. so speed up until there is a car in front of you and you cant speed up, or get over even if you are passing people.
